{
  "slug": "halyard",
  "name": "Halyard",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Connect Claude Code to human experts via Slack. Ask questions, get answers, and build organizational knowledge — all without leaving your editor.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills**, **4 hooks** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `ask-for-help` (Route questions to human experts via Slack and capture answers as organizational knowledge), `gather-context` (Gather background context before starting work or answering questions about a topic), `log-work` (Log completed work to the team knowledge base), `mark-terms` (Mark definitional terms when authoring knowledge — link org/product/industry jargon to its canonical DEFINITION entry so the graph…), `review-work` (Query the team knowledge base for recent activity, past decisions, and work context), `triage-knowledge` (Review and clear the knowledge base inbox — the queue of AI-generated candidate entries awaiting human approval before…)\n- **Hooks** (4): `SessionStart`, `UserPromptSubmit`, `PreToolUse`, `Stop`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `org-kb`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install halyard@claude-community` from `halyard-labs/claude-plugin-marketplace` (`plugins/halyard`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 6,
    "hook": 4,
    "mcp": 1
  },
